## 3. Endpoints FER Lifts (Backend)
**Nuevo archivo**: `backend/GrCup.Api/Endpoints/FerLiftEndpoints.cs`

- `POST /api/competiciones/{slug}/checkin/{inscripcionId}/openers` — Set openers
- `GET /api/competiciones/{slug}/checkin/{inscripcionId}/openers` — Get openers
- `GET /api/competiciones/{slug}/checkin/{inscripcionId}/attempts` — All attempts
- `PUT /api/competiciones/{slug}/checkin/{inscripcionId}/attempts/{liftType}/{attemptNumber}` — Update

Service: Extender InscripcionService o crear FerLiftService

